&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFKh8LQlSgOWjoZhmVN33UETUP9hYbALnxiIqCPzN4sSA&oe=6A8D7A56"}, {"file_name": "38982533_293198043571933_8596478235430145082_n.png", "id": "1222599278861935", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75203618_1222599282195268_7543529969959741226_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rmEWX6xbiOEQ7kNvwG5b6vt&_nc_oc=AdoaKO1fANgkkXelpLA36AKqVQaf9tnsYWPLP-sbbr9edMtRDpAaBD0PXWSDhYEUox4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE1AbWN-qKL3XjATpIWb3sfZASvvdWYKfxffSl2FW7wiA&oe=6A8D6B4F"}, {"file_name": "86653846_1511662882914046_7441619705300833097_n.png", "id": "408918818917948", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031452_408918822251281_925653654580631949_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7NegITcF6KcQ7kNvwFYtjWh&_nc_oc=AdoAJtl6Ma-pEmWDOHOKjCilqYpdHL4OJdb0Psc3QQqpDV9Ty3nrF9e-Tukhv6MlF6c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGEcXxjIFIwDkGD6X0wr5YE04wNL9JBaxBw5Dv237IodA&oe=6A8D6850"}, {"file_name": "38974528_300985632637458_6044806980667952672_n.png", "id": "453499873812461", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75356794_453499877145794_8306574212514530433_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5uMQ6bPLRG4Q7kNvwEDLF5U&_nc_oc=AdrnWP8tfwYgK8XrD91-tug6wLZJ0EP_8SoNN1H8UOjQo79LcTIvFIn5T0-UkUmR5rA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEZhgrX3FdAnIXKO8EoThKeIxUQ-NPzkrn2gmsIjhb-hw&oe=6A8D75A0"}, {"file_name": "39035412_1424002995154831_7627870931299930738_n.png", "id": "1197650474672785", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75622009_1197650478006118_4379851118877732930_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-XWitus5xL0Q7kNvwGf3gkT&_nc_oc=AdqbZasDJsWJDsHVNpGANjBe9qkvC2xIDEK8pVVTcLsQkgwM2daqZhTY21SmKGp1fyI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHbeFwt2W_haZFO6X5HoBRRMZJ6aam1zSNwLU0IbP0P0A&oe=6A8D6A18"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Neao", "keywords": ["Neao", "Health", "Therapy", "MentalHealth", "GroupTherapy"], "long_description": "# Revolutionizing Group Therapy with Neao\n\nNeao's cutting-edge VR platform transforms the way therapy is delivered, fostering genuine connections and personal growth in immersive environments. We set a new standard for mental health support, enhancing both group therapy and individual sessions.\n\n**Unlock Potential in Every Session:** Immerse participants in supportive, virtual spaces that encourage authentic communication and healing, enabling individuals to connect and thrive.\n\n**Empower Therapists and Participants:** With realistic simulations and personalized programs, Neao equips therapists with tools for impactful sessions, while participants benefit from a deeply engaging experience.\n\n**Enhance Remote Therapy:** Facilitate remote sessions in VR spaces that foster strong emotional connections, regardless of physical distance.\n\n**Data-Driven Insights:** Our platform offers analytics that provide therapists with actionable insights to tailor treatment to individual needs.\n\n**Accessible VR for Mental Health:** Neao\u2019s solutions revolutionize therapy, offering a more effective alternative to traditional methods.\n\n**Join Neao:** Explore how Neao's VR solutions can reshape therapy, driving better outcomes for both therapists and clients.", "short_description": "Neao is a pioneering platform delivering end-to-end VR solutions for group therapy. Our immersive VR platform with unique treatment programs creates a powerful tool for therapists and empowers individuals to connect, grow, and heal in safe and supportive virtual environments."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://neao.io/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Foretell Reality", "support_website_url": null, "website_url":